  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass m is moving along the side of a square of side &#39;a&#39;, with a uniform speed <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#965;</mi></math> in the x-y plane as shown in the figure:<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6c6b8a9d-a9ed-40c6-9b26-9ec9ef16e198-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 156px;\" /><br />Which of the following statements is false for the angular momentum <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> about the origin?",
