    "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> or <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br />For D to A, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />For A to B, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />For C to D, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced></math><br />